{
  "text": {
    "text_1": "Seajax \u00b7 Stay close to the coast",
    "text_2": "YOUR LITTLE CORNER OF BLOUBERG",
    "text_3": "Unwind by the sea.",
    "text_4": "Stay a little ",
    "text_5": "longer.",
    "text_6": "Salt on your skin. A slower kind of morning.",
    "text_7": "Four self-catering stays, a short walk from the beach.",
    "text_8": "Find your stay ",
    "text_9": "33\u00b0 SOUTH. RIGHT WHERE YOU WANT TO BE.",
    "text_10": "Discover Seajax",
    "text_11": "BLOUBERG, CAPE TOWN",
    "text_12": "Four individual stays",
    "text_13": "Self-catering freedom",
    "text_14": "5 minutes to the beach on foot",
    "text_15": "SETTLE INTO YOUR OWN SPACE",
    "text_16": "Four stays.",
    "text_17": "One coastal state of mind.",
    "text_18": "For slow mornings, beach days and time together. Explore each space, choose your favourite, and make yourself at home.",
    "text_19": "Pearl",
    "text_20": "Light & easy",
    "text_21": "Bright, calm and completely your own. A comfortable stay for one or two, with everything you need for an easy self-catering stay.",
    "text_22": "Check availability ",
    "text_23": "Coral",
    "text_24": "Ideal for longer stays",
    "text_25": "A welcoming self-catering unit that is well suited to longer stays. Make yourself comfortable, enjoy meals at home, and settle into everyday life near the coast.",
    "text_26": "Check availability ",
    "text_27": "Swell",
    "text_28": "Space to unwind",
    "text_29": "A comfortable self-catering space to settle into after a day out. Enjoy relaxed mornings at home and easy access to Blouberg and Cape Town.",
    "text_30": "Check availability ",
    "text_31": "Kelp",
    "text_32": "Your quiet corner",
    "text_33": "Set at the front of the property, Kelp offers a welcoming space with easy access in and out. Settle in, enjoy your own comfortable base, and make the most of everything nearby.",
    "text_34": "Check availability ",
    "text_35": "TAKE LIFE AT YOUR OWN PACE",
    "text_36": "A little sea air.",
    "text_37": "A change of scenery.",
    "text_38": "Take a short walk to Blouberg Beach, take in the views of Table Mountain, or spend the day discovering Cape Town. Back at Seajax, your own comfortable space is waiting.",
    "text_39": "Local weather on Windguru ",
    "text_40": "Beach days",
    "text_41": "Just a five-minute walk to the beach, with ocean views and time to relax.",
    "text_42": "Your own rhythm",
    "text_43": "Self-catering freedom for breakfast at home, an evening in, or a day out.",
    "text_44": "Explore Cape Town",
    "text_45": "Stay near the coast, within reach of the city's sights, shops and restaurants.",
    "text_46": "CLOSE TO THE WATER. CLOSE TO EVERYTHING.",
    "text_47": "A little less travelling.",
    "text_48": "A little more living.",
    "text_49": "31 Tritonia Road",
    "text_50": "Table View, Cape Town, 7441",
    "text_51": "Open in Google Maps ",
    "text_52": "Blouberg Beach",
    "text_53": "~5 min walk",
    "text_54": "Table View shops & restaurants",
    "text_55": "~10 min drive",
    "text_56": "Cape Town city centre",
    "text_57": "~25 min drive",
    "text_58": "Cape Town International Airport",
    "text_59": "~35 min drive",
    "text_60": "Travel times are approximate.",
    "text_61": "YOUR NEXT CHAPTER, BY THE SEA",
    "text_62": "See you in ",
    "text_63": "Blouberg.",
    "text_64": "Find your dates, choose your space, and make it a stay to remember.",
    "text_65": "View current rates and availability on your preferred booking platform.",
    "text_66": "Book on Airbnb ",
    "text_67": "Book on Booking.com ",
    "text_68": "info@seajax.co.za",
    "text_69": " Seajax"
  },
